OL,3,GNEWSAMurder inquiry after man dies at
OL,4,ADeal property
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have launched a murder inquiry
OL,7,Fafter a man died at a property in Deal.
OL,9,FA man in his 60s was found with a head
OL,10,Finjury on Pilots Avenue on Tuesday
OL,11,Fmorning and died while receiving
OL,12,Ftreatment from paramedics.
OL,14,FA 59-year-old man from Deal has been
OL,15,Farrested in connection with the
OL,16,Fincident, according to Kent Police.
OL,18,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,19,Fhome shortly after 10:00 BST on Tuesday
OL,20,Fafter "reports of an assault".
